1.Print the Pattern:
* * * * * 
* * * * * 
* * * * * 
* * * * * 


Solution:

public class Main{
    public static void main(String[] args){
        int n = 4;
        for(int i =1;i<=n;i++){
            for(int j=1;j<=5;j++){
                System.out.print("* ");
            }
            System.out.println();
        }

    }
}

2.Print the Pattern:
* * * * * 
*       * 
*       * 
* * * * * 


Solution:

public class Main {
    public static void main(String[] args) {
        int n = 4;
        int m = 5;

        for (int i = 1; i <= n; i++) {
            for (int j = 1; j <= m; j++) {
                if (i == 1 || j == 1 || i == n || j == m) {
                    System.out.print("*"+" ");
                }else{
                    System.out.print("  ");
                }
            }
            System.out.println();
        }
    }
}

